---
// TargetAudienceSection — "Siapa yang Cocok?" with brand colors
---

<section class="section-padding bg-page border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800" aria-label="Target Peserta">
  <div class="container-custom">
    <div class="headline-container">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-50 text-secondary font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-brand-200 mb-5">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
        Target Peserta
      </span>
      <h2 class="heading-primary mb-5">
        Pitcar Academy <span class="text-primary italic">Cocok Untuk Kamu yang...</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Program ini dirancang inklusif bagi siapa saja yang serius ingin berkembang di dunia mekanik otomotif.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Grid Criteria -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto mb-14">
      
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-brand-200 transition-all duration-300 flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0">
          🎓
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 text-base mb-1.5">Lulusan SMK/SMA</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Ingin membangun fondasi kuat dan langsung terjun berkarier di bidang otomotif.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-brand-200 transition-all duration-300 flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0">
          🏎️
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 text-base mb-1.5">Penyuka Otomotif</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Menyukai dunia otomotif tetapi belum memiliki pengalaman profesional teknis.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-brand-200 transition-all duration-300 flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0">
          🔧
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 text-base mb-1.5">Mekanik Upskilling</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Sudah menjadi mekanik dan ingin meningkatkan standar kompetensi & diagnosa.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-brand-200 transition-all duration-300 flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0">
          🏬
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 text-base mb-1.5">Incar Pengalaman Bengkel</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Ingin mendapatkan pengalaman praktik nyata langsung di lingkungan bengkel aktif.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 5 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-brand-200 transition-all duration-300 flex items-start gap-4 lg:col-span-2">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0">
          💼
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 text-base mb-1.5">Calon Pemilik Bengkel Mandiri</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Ingin memiliki fundamental teknis & pemahaman operasional sebelum membangun usaha bengkel sendiri.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Consultation CTA -->
    <div class="bg-slate-950 p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto shadow-xl text-white">
      <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black mb-3">Tidak yakin program mana yang cocok untukmu?</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base mb-6">Konsultasikan minat, latar belakang, dan tujuan kariermu bersama tim konsultan kami.</p>
      <a
        href="#konsultasi"
        data-lead-cta
        data-source-cta="audience_consultation"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-700 text-white font-extrabold px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl text-sm transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg"
      >
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M5 12h14"></path>
          <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path>
        </svg>
        Konsultasi Dengan Tim Kami
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
